  "id": "mrt",
  "term": "MRT",
  "definition": "MRT stands for muscle response testing, a form of manual muscle testing mainly used in complementary and alternative care. Unlike standard manual muscle testing, which checks neuromusculoskeletal function and strength, MRT repeatedly tests usually a single muscle as conditions change in order to look for the presence of a target condition or factors thought to contribute to it.",
